From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?J=C3=B6rg=20Thalheim?= <joerg@thalheim.io>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:30:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] client: show stalled endpoints in the shell
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A stalled endpoint silently drops input, which looks like a frozen UI.
Surface it as a "stalled" endpoint status so the existing lifecycle
notice explains why panes stopped responding, and return to "online" as
soon as traffic resumes.

Signed-off-by: Jörg Thalheim <joerg@thalheim.io>
---
 src/client/endpoint.rs            |  2 ++
 src/client/endpoint/supervisor.rs |  2 +-
 src/client/mod.rs                 | 39 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/client/shell/endpoints.rs     |  1 +
 src/client/shell/mobile.rs        |  1 +
 5 files changed, 42 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

